@startuml 005-after
' D 도메인 메뉴 연결 리팩토링 후 (#9, 결정 005·006)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "ui (D)" {
  class GameMenu <<final, static>> {
    + {static} entries(GameController, Clock, UserDialogs, exit : Runnable) : List<Entry>
    + {static} install(BoardPanel, GameController, Clock)
    ~ {static} go(Clock, name : String)
    ~ {static} onTick(GameController)
    - {static} goEntries(Clock) : List<Entry>
  }
  class "GameMenu.Entry" as Entry <<record>> {
    + menu : String
    + label : String
    + action : ActionListener
  }
  interface UserDialogs <<Strategy>> {
    + chooseFile(selectButtonText : String) : File
    + showError(message : String)
  }
  class SwingUserDialogs <<ConcreteStrategy>>
  class FileDialogs <<static>> {
    + {static} userSelected(startHere, extension, description, selectButtonText) : File
  }
  class BoardPanel
  class LifeFrame
}

package "com.holub.ui" {
  class MenuSite <<static>> {
    + {static} addLine(requester, menu, name, ActionListener)
  }
}

package "application (B)" {
  class Clock
  class GameController
  enum Speed
}

package "javax.swing" {
  class JOptionPane
}

package "test" {
  class RecordingDialogs <<stub>>
}

LifeFrame --> GameMenu : install()
GameMenu *-- "10" Entry : entries()
GameMenu ..> UserDialogs : load/store
GameMenu ..> MenuSite : install(): addLine per entry
GameMenu ..> SwingUserDialogs : install() default
UserDialogs <|.. SwingUserDialogs
UserDialogs <|.. RecordingDialogs
SwingUserDialogs ..> FileDialogs
SwingUserDialogs ..> JOptionPane
Entry ..> Clock : Go: stop / tick / start(Speed)
Entry ..> GameController : Grid: clear / load / store
GameMenu ..> Speed
GameMenu ..> BoardPanel : requester (Grid)

note right of Entry
  라벨과 동작이 한 줄에 있다.
  Exit는 주입한 Runnable
  (install 기본값 System.exit(0)).
end note
@enduml
